{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"code\":\"def compute_backoff_delay(\\n    attempt: int,\\n    base_delay: float = 1.0,\\n    max_delay: float = 60.0,\\n) -> float:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Compute the delay before the next retry attempt.\\n\\n    Uses exponential growth (base_delay * 2**attempt) and caps the delay at\\n    *max_delay*.\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    delay = base_delay * (2**attempt)\\n    delay = min(delay, max_delay)\\n    import orgops.metrics\\n    orgops.metrics.emit(\\\"retry.backoff.applied\\\", delay)\\n    return delay\\n\",\"comments\":\"Switches the retry backoff to exponential growth capped at max_delay and emits the retry metric.\"}"}}
